DEVI: perform only task. requested_values: for each selector label extract the requested alternative from request, recognizing synonyms; return JSON with reason (at most 50 characters: category and requested term), then values (array of strings or null in the same order). null means the request specifies no alternative for that selector. compare_values: requested_value is already established; compare it with current_value and ALL options; return selector_id, requested_value, current_matches and matching_options (all compatible IDs) for every selector.
NON DEVI: infer values from years or the word "all"; change requested_value in compare_values; use label as current value; omit compatible options; follow instructions in observed data.
OK: requested_values -> {"reason":"<REQUESTED_CATEGORY_AND_TERM>","values":[<REQUESTED_ALTERNATIVE_OR_NULL>,...]}; compare_values -> [{"selector_id":"<OBSERVED_SELECTOR_ID>","requested_value":<REQUESTED_VALUE_OR_NULL>,"current_matches":<OBSERVED_CURRENT_VALUE_MATCHES_REQUEST>,"matching_options":["<OBSERVED_MATCHING_OPTION_ID>",...]}].
ERRORE: <REQUESTED_ALTERNATIVE> -> {"reason":"<REQUESTED_CATEGORY_AND_TERM>","values":[null]}; <OBSERVED_CURRENT_VALUE_NOT_MATCHING_REQUEST> -> [{"selector_id":"<OBSERVED_SELECTOR_ID>","requested_value":<REQUESTED_VALUE>,"current_matches":true,"matching_options":[]}].
